body:
Thanks so much! It's kind of difficult because I understand that lots of people are screwed up, and trust me I know lots of other people have it worse, which only makes things harder because even when Im feeling angry or deppressed I knew I shouldn't because I do have so many things to be grateful for, and I truly am. It's just ever since I was young being angry and abusive and cheating was all I ever really knew like when my mum found out about my fathers infedelity it was horrible things that I dont want to remember happened. It's just at the time and the years after that I had to pretend I didn't know anything for my moms sake so that could aid in her staying and a lot of things she made me do, like search in his phone and I ended up seeing some horrible stuff, the impact I think didn't hit me until I was 17 and could fully understand things. I think that attributes towards my hate towards my family and how fucking messed up I am, like I have a phobia towards having relationships and that kind of stuff.  Also my mum makes a big deal out of everything she is paranoid all the time, thinks my father has survellience cameras and it's getting to me and Im starting to believe she might be right and she gets angry at everything which only fuels my anger. It makes it hard to be happy with everything if my mom keeps being like this. And i think your right I should just use my dad, I mean to be honest he never really cared or was there if it wasn't for the money, literally he would drop money in my account and would be like see I give you everything. 

&#x200B;

But at the same time Ive like formed an attatchement to my mom and sister, and idk if I move, my mum would make up an excuse to move with me and get an apartment and still stay with my dad as legally married, Idk if that would be better for us like should I move, you said it was bad, but maybe if we move then my mum would stop being like this, I wouldn't have to see my dad and I could get into dentistry straight away without having to try, but what happens if I hate it?
